<title>USA: Gulf South Medical completes Gateway buy.</title>
<headline>Gulf South Medical completes Gateway buy.</headline>
<dateline>RIDGELAND, Miss. 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gulf South Medical Supply said on Friday it completed the previously announced acquisition of privately-held Gateway Healthcare Corp.</p>
<p>Based in Richmond, Va., Gateway Healthcare distributes medical supplies and related products to long-term care facilities and office-based physicians.</p>
<p>The company said Gateway had a strong presence in the New England and Mid-Atlantic regions, with sales of about $67 million for the past twelve-month period.</p>
</text>
